    25	
    26	- [bff-api-design.yaml](bff-api-design.yaml): OpenAPI fragment, merged into `brain-api.yaml` by the feature run.
    27	- [migration-design.sql](migration-design.sql)
    28	- [contract-inventory.yaml](contract-inventory.yaml)
    29	- Three design schemas under `planning-mds/schemas/`: `browser-session-v1`, `active-knowledge-base-update-v1` and `logout-result-v1`.
